{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2023-05-15 14:26:00', 'title': 'COMED CONNECTS RECORD NUMBER OF CUSTOMERS WITH BILL-ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS IN FIRST QUARTER OF 2023', 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--DURING THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2023, COMED HELPED CONNECT MORE THAN 87,000 ELIGIBLE CUSTOMERS TO MORE THAN $26 MILLION IN BILL ASSISTANCE. THIS IS BOTH THE LARGEST AMOUNT OF ASSISTANCE PROVIDED – AND SECOND-LARGEST NUMBER OF CUSTOMERS SUPPORTED – FOR ANY FIRST QUARTER DATING BACK TO AT LEAST 2019. IN ALL OF 2022, COMED CONNECTED 211,000 ELIGIBLE CUSTOMERS TO NEARLY $129 MILLION IN ASSISTANCE. THESE RESULTS COME AFTER COMED HAS INTRODUCED NEW FINANCIAL ASSISTANCE OPTIONS T.'}